  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.05000000000000071,
      "end": 2.450000000000002,
      "text": "Open the portfolio to prioritize workloads."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.73,
      "end": 5.81,
      "text": "Is the workload evidence sufficient for a decision?"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.45,
      "end": 12.57,
      "text": "Enterprise DNA organizes eighteen attributes across six dimensions: business,"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.030000000000001,
      "end": 19.19,
      "text": "technology, dependencies, economics, data and risk, and target state."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.19,
      "end": 22.23,
      "text": "Inspect the values and verification status."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.150000000000002,
      "end": 28.310000000000002,
      "text": "Relationship views support context, while missing and incomplete fields show where"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.310000000000002,
      "end": 30.17,
      "text": "further investigation is needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.17,
      "end": 35.57,
      "text": "The deterministic readiness gate requires at least seventy percent completeness and"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.57,
      "end": 36.99,
      "text": "zero critical gaps."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.650000000000006,
      "end": 41.17,
      "text": "Confidence, completeness, and readiness are different signals."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.18000000000001,
      "end": 43.220000000000006,
      "text": "Next ask what evidence is missing."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.220000000000006,
      "end": 47.260000000000005,
      "text": "The Portfolio Discovery Specialist uses Gemini to reason about heterogeneous"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.260000000000005,
      "end": 51.32,
      "text": "evidence, relationships, ambiguity, and missing facts."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.370000000000005,
      "end": 54.010000000000005,
      "text": "Verify facts using appropriate evidence."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.025000000000006,
      "end": 59.565000000000005,
      "text": "Next, carry the workload context into assessment; readiness still requires separate"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.565000000000005,
      "end": 60.385,
      "text": "human approval."
    }
  ],
